  "description": "*“If you don't mind... could you buy me?”*\n\nChoi Yu-jae, a nightclub waiter paying off his debts day by day by selling fake alcohol.\n\nEver since the night he was caught selling fake alcohol by Kang San-hyuk, San-hyuk’s possessiveness completely blocks Yu-jae from doing business.\n\nWith customers avoiding Yu-jae one by one and even his livelihood cut off, Yu-jae ultimately finds himself clinging to the man who ruined him...\n\n*“We only have to do it 80 more times, what are you crying for?”* *(Source: RIDI, translated)*\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/6062000722), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000154829), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11982763), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=922029164)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/night_2)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561019044)",
